ext-slate-500">0 <span class="text-slate-400">words</span></span></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 px-4 py-2 text-[11px] text-slate-500"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">AS footer and unsubscribe links are appended automatically.</span><span class="ml-auto text-slate-500">Preview and send a test on the next step.</span></div></div></div></div><footer class="mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><button type="button" variant="outline" class="gap-1.5">Back</button></div><button type="button" aria-disabled="true" disabled="" class="gap-1.5 active:scale-[0.98] active:transition-transform motion-reduce:active:scale-100">Continue</button></footer></section>"`;
